n_en: (physics) the process in which there is movement of a substance from an area of high concentration of that substance to an area of lower concentration\n- direct_hypernym: عملية موجودة في الطبيعة أو ناتجة عنها\n\nThis is clearly **diffusion** — a physical process where substances move from areas of higher concentration to lower concentration. Now I'll generate four candidate lemmas based purely on this definition, without looking at the existing ones.\n\nThe core concept involves particles or molecules migrating across concentration gradients, which is fundamental to Arabic physics terminology. Let me consider some options: **تَنَفُّذ** from the root meaning \"to pass through\" could capture the penetration aspect, though \"نفاذية\" typically refers to permeability. There's also **تَشَرُّب** which relates to absorption and spreading, and other candidates like \"نفاذ\" and \"سريان\" that describe movement and flow. The most commonly used term in modern Arabic physics is \"انتشار,\" but I'm exploring alternatives here.\n\nLooking at the definition more carefully—the process where substance moves from high concentration to low concentration areas—I'm narrowing down which root and pattern best captures this specific meaning without relying on the most obvious choice. knowing existing lemmas):\n\n1. **تَسَرُّب** (ishtiqaq) - from س-ر-ب, pattern تَفَعُّل, meaning seepage/percolation/leakage. This captures the idea of substance moving through.\n\n2. **نَفَاذ** (ishtiqaq) - from ن-ف-ذ, مصدر of نَفَذَ, meaning permeation/penetration. Used in \"نفاذ الضوء\" (light permeation).\n\n3. **تَخَلُّل** (ishtiqaq) - from خ-ل-ل, pattern تَفَعُّل, meaning infiltration/permeation. \"تخلل السائل في المادة\" is used.\n\n4. **تَغَلْغُل** (ishtiqaq) - from غ-ل-غ-ل (quadrilateral), pattern تَفَعْلَل, meaning deep penetration/permeation. \"تغلغل المادة في الوسط\" works well here.\n\nAlternatively, **سَيَلان** captures the sense of flowing movement, though it's more specifically about liquid flow. **إِنْسِيَاب** could work too, but I'm still working through the root derivation for that one.\n\nLooking at what's already in the synset—\"انتشار\" and \"تداخل\"—I should pick candidates that don't overlap too much with those existing lemmas.\n\n\"انتشار\" is the standard physics term for diffusion, derived from the root ن-ش-ر with the pattern انفعال, meaning spreading or propagation. It's widely used in Arabic physics textbooks and fits well.\n\n\"تداخل\" is more problematic. While it comes from د-خ-ل with the pattern تفاعل, its primary meaning in physics is \"interference\" (as in wave interference), not diffusion. It can mean intermingling, but that's too vague and doesn't capture the specific movement from high to low concentration. Using it for diffusion risks confusion with its established physics terminology.\n\nNow I'm running database queries to check the existing lemmas and my candidate terms against the lexicon. I'll normalize the forms and look up انتشار, تداخل, تسرب, نفاذ, تخلل, and تغلغل to see what the database shows.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":7346,"cache_read_input_tokens":29870,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":7346,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5a0f7754-1536-44a4-a1d8-fae4cd58d295","uuid":"7afb64ab-04fc-4117-ace5-3caed6bf3f17"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_01JMQAtqhaAjRY6464C517Q1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"لا يوجد evidence.json مُسبق. سأبدأ بالمراحل وأُجري الاستعلامات اللازمة.\n\n---\n\n## المرحلة ١ — التوليد الأعمى (بناءً على الملف المُقنَّع)\n\n**من التعريف فقط:** العملية الفيزيائية التي تنتقل فيها مادة من منطقة تركيز عالٍ إلى منطقة تركيز أقل.\n\nالمرشحات الأربعة (قبل الاطلاع على اللمّات الموجودة):\n1. **تَسَرُّب** — اشتقاق: من س-ر-ب، تَفَعُّل، يفيد انسياب المادة واختراقها.\n2. **نَفَاذ** — اشتقاق: من ن-ف-ذ، مصدر نَفَذَ، يفيد اختراق المادة للوسط.\n3. **تَخَلُّل** — اشتقاق: من خ-ل-ل، تَفَعُّل، يفيد تغلغل المادة في الوسط.\n4. **تَغَلْغُل** — اشتقاق: من غ-ل-غ-ل (رباعي)، تَفَعْلَل، يفيد الاختراق العميق التدريجي.\n\nالآن أُجري استعلامات قاعدة البيانات (الاستعلام ١ + ٧ في آنٍ واحد):"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":7346,"cache_read_input_tokens":29870,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":7346,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5a0f7754-1536-44a4-a1d8-fae4cd58d295","uuid":"2bae004e-05b6-4db2-8195-5a441f4034b8"}
